{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06062","headline":"奉和圣制庆玄元皇帝玉像之作应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制庆玄元皇帝玉像之作应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明君梦帝先，宝命上齐天。\n秦后徒闻乐，周王耻卜年。\n玉京移大像，金籙会羣仙。\n承露调天供，临空敞御筵。\n斗廻迎寿酒，山近起鑪烟。\n愿奉无爲化，斋心学自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}